            Note: There are more Tom Petty tabs on this site in the 'P' file under 'Petty Tom'.

There are quite a few tabs for this classic song but I'm pretty sure most of them,
which are tabbed in the key of D, are wrong. If you use standard tuning and place a
capo on the third fret you can play the song keyed in F which I think sounds a lot
better.

